{"title":"The Lantern-Eater","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Lantern-Eater is a named <a href=\"#/monster/lantern-eater\">Lantern-Eater</a> seen at level 40–55.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Lantern-Eater</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Moonfane</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 10×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6101\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-lantern-eater\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"moth-silk\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moth Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"luna-wing\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wispweave-legs\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0d0df26ca27f47055408.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wispweave Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"plume-legs\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4795cee218d4f22fc4c2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Plume Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c0c11b01db6e83ae53a8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/612eb1b2115c7c63ce78.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c92787d8673dbae51c75.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Lantern-Eater</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/lantern-eater\">Lantern-Eater</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>40–55</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>2,525</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>24 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}